# Fusecheck fixture (scripts/fusecheck-check.sh --selftest, issue #766):
# the control part `fused` lives two include hops away (closure-child.scad
# → closure-mid.scad → fixtures.scad). The runner must accept it. Assert
# rows reuse the already-rendered separable fixture.
assert fusecheck-fixtures-separable.stl 2
control fused 1
